# partition: large input (n=1000) to verify O(n) performance
# [range 0 1000] has 1000 elements; evens go to pass, odds to fail (500 each)
[+
    [length [get "pass" [partition [fn [let x] [= [mod x 2] 0]] [collect [range 0 1000]]]]]
    [length [get "fail" [partition [fn [let x] [= [mod x 2] 0]] [collect [range 0 1000]]]]]]
=== out
Int(1000)
